{"cluster_id": "C-3728", "topic": "The old TLA classifier pattern `[A-Za-z_]+` failed to recognize invariant names ", "target": "operations/debugging", "member_ids": ["B029-042"], "canonical_claim": "The old TLA classifier pattern `[A-Za-z_]+` failed to recognize invariant names containing digits such as `I1ForgetTerminal` and `I2EarnedFarewell`; widening it to `[A-Za-z0-9_]+` was required to avoid false `error` outcomes and false passes based only on nonzero exit codes.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/models/2026-07-28-v9-phase-RESULTS.md#regex-digits"]}
{"cluster_id": "C-3729", "topic": "The T15 trace dump SELECT aliased `'${tt}' AS trace_type`, and ClickHouse alias ", "target": "operations/debugging", "member_ids": ["B030-077"], "canonical_claim": "The T15 trace dump SELECT aliased `'${tt}' AS trace_type`, and ClickHouse alias resolution in `WHERE` caused the literal to shadow the table column, so the dump was an unfiltered mix of trace types until fix `52f110e94b3`.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/reports/2026-07-29-gc-perf-audit-soak.md#addendum-method"]}
