{"cluster_id": "C-3734", "topic": "Consolidated The pinned TLC runner had to recognize both `Temporal properties ", "target": "operations/debugging", "member_ids": ["B036-031", "B048-048"], "canonical_claim": "The pinned TLC runner had to recognize both `Temporal properties were violated.` and the named-property form `Temporal property EventuallyFolded was violated.`; otherwise `sab_unbounded_defer` was misclassified as an error. Additionally, The pinned TLC runner classifier accepts both `Temporal properties were violated` and `Temporal property <Name> was violated` forms, and the latter singular form is emitted by the pinned `TLC2 Version 2026.07.18.145032` jar for a single `PROPERTY`.", "issue_ids": ["T7"], "sources": [".superpowers/sdd/2026-08-02-cas-stage-b-remaining/t7-laneB-report.md#L48-L80", "docs/superpowers/models/CaGcRoundDeferCore_RESULTS.md#2026-08-03-runner-suite-run"]}
